  "subject": {
    "id": "optional-pack-conformance-closure",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Close edited-pack list and import preservation gaps.",
  "why": "The conformance rite previously issued receipts for duplicate declaration-list members and missing required imports that the compiler then refused. The smallest correction applies the existing unique set-equivalence rule to preserved declaration lists and root imports, keeping the rite structural, offline, and independent of pack-specific semantics."
